        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Then set a time, pull down the lever, open the gate, and..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Done."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#10$2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Good, just like I thought."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "This way, I'll have nothing to worry about even if something unexpected happens."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#1$2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Now, there's just one last thing to do..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "I need to go find her."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
