        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "When did you find out, Lucian?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "The first to notice your abnormal behavior was Miss.Christine, not me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "In that very first scene after I joined the cast, she intruded upon the shoot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "She rarely approaches anyone other than me, but she approached you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Since then, she has made contact with you many times."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Tippi believed she decided to accompany you as you watched movies in the prop room because she likes the both of you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "That is only half correct."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Miss.Christine was only ever interested in you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Look. Even now, even as you hold that dreadful dagger, she still stands by your side."
    },
