    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Ridiculous..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Don't tell me that's your only reason to suspect me? Just because this mysterious creature is fond of me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#13$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Or maybe she only does what you tell her to. She is your pet, after all..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira looks into Miss.Christine's deep, blue eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "The very next moment, she no longer has conscious control over herself."
    },
    {
        "text": "Joy, sorrow, anger. All sorts of emotions roil through her heart, before finally settling into a blank void, one that terrifies anyone looking upon it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "You continue to misunderstand her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "As I have explained before, none may interfere with her intentions and actions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "I did not merely mean that she is free-spirited by nature, but rather, nobody has the 'ability' to interfere with her."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "It is she who possesses the 'ability' to influence others."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_meowlong",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "The mysterious black creature nonchalantly licks her paws."
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira finds it difficult to reconcile the Miss.Christine she sees now with the enormous pressure she felt earlier."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Miss.Christine is extremely sensitive to emotions. No carefully buried pain or flicker of malice escapes her notice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Over countless years, she has wandered across all of Terra, tasting the entire spectrum of feeling."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Rather than any particular flavor, she prefers a blend."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "And her judgment is derived from instinct rather than logic. It does not err."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Solving a murder without even discovering a motive. Should I congratulate you?"
    },
